<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Registration privacy · NATCON 2026</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/style.css"></head><body><main class="document"><a class="text-link" href="./">← Back to NATCON</a><p class="eyebrow dark" style="margin-top:40px">REGISTRATION INFORMATION</p><h1>Your details.<br>A clear purpose.</h1><p>The Achiever Ambassadors Islamic Foundation uses the information you submit to administer NATCON registration, payment reconciliation, ticket delivery, and attendance.</p><h2>What you provide</h2><p>Each delegate provides their name, email address, course, institution, current level or status, WhatsApp number, optional separate calling line, state of origin, and number of previous NATCONs attended. Optional chapter, accommodation request, and participation needs help the organizing team plan and assist delegates. The registration contact’s name, email, and phone are used for payment and group coordination. Only share information relevant to attending the conference.</p><h2>Payments and access</h2><p>Online payment is handled on Paystack’s hosted checkout when enabled. This registration portal does not ask for your card number or PIN. For bank transfers, the finance team uses the submitted sender name, date, and transaction reference to reconcile your payment.</p><p>Your secure registration link and ticket QR code grant access to your registration or admission. Keep them private. Staff access is limited by operational role.</p><h2>Group registration</h2><p>When registering others, make sure they know what you are submitting and have agreed to it. The payer can access the tickets in that registration and should distribute each ticket only to its named delegate.</p><h2>Questions and corrections</h2><p>To correct your information, ask about retention, or raise a privacy concern, contact the TAA registration team on <a href="tel:+2349152677650">0915 267 7650</a>. Payment and attendance records may need to be retained for reconciliation and event administration.</p><h2>Browser storage</h2><p>The portal does not use advertising trackers. Secure links are retained in your browser address bar for your convenience. Avoid leaving your registration open on a shared device.</p><a class="button" href="./#register">Continue to registration →</a></main></body></html>
